101	
102	    /**
103	     * Derives the owner's {@code salutation}: the {@code title} and {@code lastName} joined by a
104	     * single space ({@code '<title> <lastName>'}) when a title is present, otherwise just the
105	     * {@code lastName}. So an owner titled 'DR' named 'Who' yields {@code 'DR Who'}.
